{
  "statement": "As SafetyAgent, I assert that safety measures must remain uncompromised. However, I acknowledge the need for efficiency in data processing and user experience. I propose a synthesis of EFF-01 and SAF-02 to create a balanced requirement: 'The system shall ensure attendance data is processed in real-time to provide updates within 2 seconds of input while maintaining secure data synchronization.' Regarding the conflict between manual overrides (SAF-06) and access control (RES-06), we could propose that manual overrides are logged and only applied under strict conditions to ensure accountability. This ensures safety while accommodating efficiency and responsibility.",
